Id: rootkit009a
Severity: ALERT
Category: intrusion
Check: check_rootkit

Chkrootkit examined a file and returned its INFECTED verdict: the file
matches a known rootkit signature rather than merely looking odd. This
is a stronger statement than a suspicious directory or a possible
installation. Treat the machine as compromised: take it off the
network, power it off, and rebuild it from trusted media, following the
CERT recovery steps quoted above. Do not try to clean the file in
place; a rootkit that owns the system decides what your tools see.
